            "value" : "Your subscription still renews. Turn off renewal under Usage & Billing in Comma on the web or on your Mac, then delete your account."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的订阅还会自动续费。请先在网页版或 Mac 上 Comma 的「用量与账单」里关闭续费，再删除账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every device is signed out at once, and your account is deleted for good after 7 days: your tasks, chats, files and remaining credits will no longer be available, and connected channels are disconnected. Sign in again with this email within 7 days to cancel the deletion. We will email a code to %@ to confirm." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every device is signed out at once, and your account is deleted for good after 7 days: your tasks, chats, files and remaining credits will no longer be available, and connected channels are disconnected. Sign in again with this email within 7 days to cancel the deletion. We will email a code to %@ to confirm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确认后所有设备会立即退出登录，账号在 7 天后永久删除：你的任务、对话、文件和剩余 credits 将无法再访问，已连接的渠道会断开，删除后无法恢复。7 天内用这个邮箱重新登录即可撤销删除。我们会向 %@ 发送验证码来确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
